<title>USA: Santa Fe declares special preferred dividend.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe declares special preferred dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe Energy Resources Inc said Tuesday it has declared a special dividend of $0.222 per share of seven percent preferred Stock to cover all accrued and unpaid amounts in respect to the 7 percent preferred stock through the Conversion Date, payable on May 27, 1997 to holders of record on May 16, 1997.</p>
